      "exercise": "283",
      "text": "由$b_1=\\frac{b_k}{q^{k-1}}$。\na) $b_1=\\frac{384}{2^7}=3$；\nb) $b_1=\\frac{32/81}{(-2/3)^5}=-3$。"
